source: tests/cli/invariants.rs
expression: top
---
Navigate and sync your GitHub repositories

Usage: work [COMMAND]

Commands:
  cd           Jump to a repository (needs shell integration)
  on           Jump to a repository and open it in your editor (needs shell integration)
  edit         Open a repository in your editor
  clone        Clone a repository into the work directory
  browse       Open a repository's page in the browser
  open         Open a repository's directory in the file manager
  pull         Fetch and fast-forward one repository
  sync         Fetch and fast-forward every cloned repository
  list         List cached repositories
  update       Refresh the repository cache
  favorite     Pick favourite organisations for a domain
  setup        Interactive first-time setup
  config       Show or change configuration
  auth         Manage GitHub authentication through gh
  completions  Print or install shell completions
  activate     Print the shell integration script
  version      Print the version
  about        Show the animated about screen
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
